        security: "Evaluation environments must never touch production data or real customers; use seeded test accounts and sandboxed systems.",
        checklist: ['Task suite from real workflows', 'Deterministic seeded environments, reset per run', 'End-state checks including no unintended changes', 'Several trials per task; pass@1 and consistency', 'Latency percentiles with adequate sample sizes', 'Cost and steps per successful task', 'Sampled human review of recordings'],
        sources: ['Zhou et al., "WebArena" (2023)', 'Xie et al., "OSWorld" (NeurIPS 2024)', 'Yao et al., "τ-bench" (2024)', 'Hyndman and Fan, "Sample Quantiles in Statistical Packages" (1996)'],
